  "description": "Vali-Time is a lightweight .NET library for converting and managing time units, including milliseconds, seconds, minutes, and hours. It offers a precise and flexible API for time conversions, summations, breakdowns, and human-readable formatting. With support for full precision calculations, optional rounding, and cultural formatting, Vali-Time is ideal for handling time-related operations in .NET applications, integrating seamlessly with dependency injection frameworks.",
